# Extracted manuscript text is NOT committed.
#
# Submissions under review are confidential; the EditSleuth PDF, for example,
# carries "Confidential reviewer copy ... Unauthorized sharing, redistribution, or
# disclosure is strictly prohibited" on every page. paper.txt and paper_clean.txt
# are the complete manuscript, so committing them to a repository that may be
# pushed or shared is redistribution.
#
# Quoting passages inside a review is normal reviewing practice and stays. Carrying
# the whole manuscript in version control does not. Regenerate locally with:
#     ./workflow/scripts/run_review.sh <submission>.pdf <slug>
*/artifacts/paper.txt
*/artifacts/paper_clean.txt

# Source PDFs, likewise.
*.pdf
